From e05ea46bf232a2fee6804b98af42ea5806050b7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:30:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dwc2d: counters of the network adapter in
 /tmp/dwc2d-netstats, for diagnosis

RX/TX frames and errors with the last error code, the time of the last
frame each way, interrupts and scheme events, written every 5 s. They
tell whether frames still come from the adapter when the network stops
(#92).
